    {
      "id": "KkPIJ0jvYny6I_8MxaEKY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14927.424849866507,
      "y": 1221.1103537643978,
      "width": 1371.5834688204593,
      "height": 662.3343338645785,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "94r_Gywpa6QWcPlqpz3uf",
        "jqF2E1h8xxWKkKMnp1aej"
      ],
      "frameId": "Fnlwz43JHThA1nqtc3d8M",
      "index": "b3EO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 785666272,
      "version": 882,
      "versionNonce": 384263816,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764625965178,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Inventory is like a spreadsheet containing details of the software\nsystem or application against its name. \n\nFirstly, a table is built that lists all the software applications.\nList of criteria is established on the basis of:\n\n    + Name of the software application.\n    + Year of its creation.\n    + Number of changes it had gone through since its creation.\n    + Effort applied in making those modifications.\n    + Date on which the last modification was made.\n    + The systems in which the application now resides.\n    + Other applications to which it interfaces",
      "fontSize": 40.75903593012791,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Inventory is like a spreadsheet containing details of the software system or application against its name. \n\nFirstly, a table is built that lists all the software applications.\nList of criteria is established on the basis of:\n\n    + Name of the software application.\n    + Year of its creation.\n    + Number of changes it had gone through since its creation.\n    + Effort applied in making those modifications.\n    + Date on which the last modification was made.\n    + The systems in which the application now resides.\n    + Other applications to which it interfaces",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "djMy-UFOiUs2jmDCROnPK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15410.36691041205,
      "y": 2114.6879647008072,
      "width": 1068.5698266141453,
      "height": 516.6102263461556,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0000ff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "94r_Gywpa6QWcPlqpz3uf",
        "jqF2E1h8xxWKkKMnp1aej"
      ],
      "frameId": "Fnlwz43JHThA1nqtc3d8M",
      "index": "b3EV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 5036256,
      "version": 776,
      "versionNonce": 982394360,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764625965178,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Creating documentation is far too time consuming. If\nthe system works, we’ll live with what we have. It is not\npossible to re-create documentation for hundreds of\ncomputer programs.\n\n• Documentation must be updated, but we have limited\nresources. We’ll use a “document when touched” approach.\n\n• The system is business critical and must be fully re-\ndocumented. Even in this case, an intelligent approach is\nto pare documentation to an essential minimum.",
      "fontSize": 37.57165282517496,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Creating documentation is far too time consuming. If the system works, we’ll live with what we have. It is not possible to re-create documentation for hundreds of computer programs.\n\n• Documentation must be updated, but we have limited resources. We’ll use a “document when touched” approach.\n\n• The system is business critical and must be fully re-documented. Even in this case, an intelligent approach is to pare documentation to an essential minimum.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "92EaykVjZRcww28zfqoct",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 11493.716045422627,
      "y": 1159.564231139628,
      "width": 946.8457209643677,
      "height": 735.7195697588218,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
