    {
      "id": "PQZ5uIAn51gIJ6NOACJrf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11259.973447746941,
      "y": 2934.3612904837464,
      "width": 1152.6845837107587,
      "height": 494.5792587095894,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "94r_Gywpa6QWcPlqpz3uf",
        "jqF2E1h8xxWKkKMnp1aej"
      ],
      "frameId": "Fnlwz43JHThA1nqtc3d8M",
      "index": "b3Ed",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 287660320,
      "version": 1060,
      "versionNonce": 2059839224,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764625965178,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Source code is analyzed using a restructuring tool.\n\n• Poorly design code segments are redesigned.\n\n• Violations of structured programming are noted & code is\nthen restructured (can be automated)\n\n• The resultant restructured code is reviewed and tested\n\n• Internal code documentation is updated",
      "fontSize": 39.56634069676715,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Source code is analyzed using a restructuring tool.\n\n• Poorly design code segments are redesigned.\n\n• Violations of structured programming are noted & code is then restructured (can be automated)\n\n• The resultant restructured code is reviewed and tested\n\n• Internal code documentation is updated",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LclFEbyaxvs2mttsGdbYx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11133.821857405286,
      "y": 2136.1314321284635,
      "width": 1125.9019687556392,
      "height": 561.0860977220879,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "94r_Gywpa6QWcPlqpz3uf",
        "jqF2E1h8xxWKkKMnp1aej"
      ],
      "frameId": "Fnlwz43JHThA1nqtc3d8M",
      "index": "b3El",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1874732320,
      "version": 778,
      "versionNonce": 2006279304,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764625965178,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Current data architecture is dissected and necessary data\nmodels are defined.\n\n• Data objects and attributes are identified, and existing\ndata structures are reviewed for quality.\n\n• When data structure is weak, the data are re-engineered.\n\n• Data architecture has a strong influence on program\narchitecture and the algorithms that populate it, changes to\nthe data will invariably result in architectural/code-level\nchanges.",
      "fontSize": 37.40573984813918,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Current data architecture is dissected and necessary data models are defined.\n\n• Data objects and attributes are identified, and existing data structures are reviewed for quality.\n\n• When data structure is weak, the data are re-engineered.\n\n• Data architecture has a strong influence on program architecture and the algorithms that populate it, changes to the data will invariably result in architectural/code-level changes.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
