      "updated": 1764623323780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "+ Equivalence Class Partitioning\n                split into groups of\nvalid/invalid; from each group pick few\ninputs; same coverage for less inputs\n    \n+ Boundary Value Analysis\n    test the edges of input ranges\n\n+ Decision Table\n\n+ Cause-effect graphing\n    inputs+outputs -> logic graph using\n&|or|~",
      "fontSize": 40.25369976727404,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "+ Equivalence Class Partitioning\n                split into groups of valid/invalid; from each group pick few inputs; same coverage for less inputs\n    \n+ Boundary Value Analysis\n    test the edges of input ranges\n\n+ Decision Table\n\n+ Cause-effect graphing\n    inputs+outputs -> logic graph using &|or|~",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
