      "updated": 1764626141611,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cyclomatic Complexity : number of linearly independent\npaths through a program’s source code.\n\nC  = Edges − Nodes + 2\nC = Number of Decision nodes + 1\nC = Number of regions in the graph\n",
      "fontSize": 43.815357678587674,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cyclomatic Complexity : number of linearly independent paths through a program’s source code.\n\nC  = Edges − Nodes + 2\nC = Number of Decision nodes + 1\nC = Number of regions in the graph\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
