      "updated": 1764600680243,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Refinement & instantiation: Based on feedback\nfrom the prototype, the business process is\nrefined and then instantiated within a\nbusiness system.",
      "fontSize": 51.5352064972463,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Refinement & instantiation: Based on feedback from the prototype, the business process is refined and then instantiated within a business system.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fugNbG_pU5mJYNEQEICY-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6622.682587592956,
      "y": 2721.2271476056303,
      "width": 849.1745434578105,
      "height": 258.686996940099,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "i_gz0-4RMwgFTO6Y8tdhg"
      ],
      "frameId": "Fnlwz43JHThA1nqtc3d8M",
      "index": "b4d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 34000096,
      "version": 1314,
      "versionNonce": 1604554343,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764600680243,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Prototyping: A redesigned\nbusiness process must be\nprototyped before it is fully\nintegrated into the business.",
      "fontSize": 51.73739938801982,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prototyping: A redesigned business process must be prototyped before it is fully integrated into the business.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-1qtnH_6kZ6gWF1irE-MK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6584.693014978061,
      "y": 3330.2149545635493,
      "width": 1003.2299729279531,
      "height": 323.3587461751239,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "i_gz0-4RMwgFTO6Y8tdhg"
      ],
      "frameId": "Fnlwz43JHThA1nqtc3d8M",
      "index": "b4dV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 488233184,
      "version": 1482,
      "versionNonce": 1628645767,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764600680243,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Process specification and design:\nBased on information obtained\nduring the first three BPR activities,\nuse-cases are prepared for each\nprocess that is to be redesigned.",
      "fontSize": 51.73739938801982,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Process specification and design: Based on information obtained\nduring the first three BPR activities, use-cases are prepared for each process that is to be redesigned.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QC52iJ8R-kJqksBsFB2Wg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9633.394681125968,
      "y": 3401.7006614320144,
      "width": 1003.2299729279531,
      "height": 194.01524770507433,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
