      "text": "Economics of Re-engineering",
      "fontSize": 135.58169565219845,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Economics of Re-engineering",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5z4hdv66ShVxf7uh2a_5N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6938.077624059117,
      "y": 4653.895083153866,
      "width": 1322.942256249668,
      "height": 647.3697412154448,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "wOpBsTA29ZBaF_nm7HzBM",
        "w1sayL8v-oqqFl8-1U6yx"
      ],
      "frameId": "Fnlwz43JHThA1nqtc3d8M",
      "index": "b5QV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 319599840,
      "version": 818,
      "versionNonce": 715879655,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764600680243,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A cost/benefit analysis model for reengineering.\nParameters:\n\n• P1 = current annual maintenance cost\n• P2 = current annual operation cost\n• P3 = current annual business value\n• P4 = predicted annual maintenance cost after reengineering.\n• P5 = predicted annual operations cost after reengineering.\n• P6 = predicted annual business value after reengineering.\n• P7 = estimated reengineering costs.\n• P8 = estimated reengineering calendar time.\n• P9 = reengineering risk factor (P9 = 1.0 is nominal).\n• L = expected life of the system.",
      "fontSize": 39.838137920950444,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A cost/benefit analysis model for reengineering.\nParameters:\n\n• P1 = current annual maintenance cost\n• P2 = current annual operation cost\n• P3 = current annual business value\n• P4 = predicted annual maintenance cost after reengineering.\n• P5 = predicted annual operations cost after reengineering.\n• P6 = predicted annual business value after reengineering.\n• P7 = estimated reengineering costs.\n• P8 = estimated reengineering calendar time.\n• P9 = reengineering risk factor (P9 = 1.0 is nominal).\n• L = expected life of the system.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
