    {
      "id": "A-QOTDMWit9bvNPAiDdSr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25518.483099125937,
      "y": 3328.6290550328163,
      "width": 578.3120822693447,
      "height": 154.6242474839098,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "HF6vU6thaUYOknkUxiIWi"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6Rl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1808851168,
      "version": 321,
      "versionNonce": 1781111739,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764603458344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " A Collaboration is a collection of\nnamed objects and actors with links\nconnecting them. They collaborate in\nperforming some task.",
      "fontSize": 30.92484949678196,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " A Collaboration is a collection of named objects and actors with links connecting them. They collaborate in performing some task.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iiHUbhFMsPmNg2GP0kMuk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22200.83848152149,
      "y": 3329.3093798481204,
      "width": 530.0896098884285,
      "height": 171.64565807384946,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "HF6vU6thaUYOknkUxiIWi"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6Rt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1703392480,
      "version": 316,
      "versionNonce": 999582811,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764603458344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "shows components, provided\nand required interfaces,\nports, and relationships\nbetween them.",
      "fontSize": 34.32913161476989,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "shows components, provided and required interfaces,\nports, and relationships between them.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9nLVHTSfxfXHVxm0Ja13Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21349.05006161647,
      "y": 3217.723751307366,
      "width": 688.9154434732202,
      "height": 309.446281287239,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "HF6vU6thaUYOknkUxiIWi"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 538516768,
      "version": 784,
      "versionNonce": 77342971,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "-DPZesPRV_K3Bi7R8OX3u",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764603458344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ELEMENTS\n\n• Component- logical unit block of the system\n• Interface- describes a group of operations\nused or created by components\n• Dependency (dashed arrow)\n• Port- to help expose required and provided\ninterfaces of a component.",
      "fontSize": 30.944628128723902,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ELEMENTS\n\n• Component- logical unit block of the system\n• Interface- describes a group of operations used or created by components\n• Dependency (dashed arrow)\n• Port- to help expose required and provided interfaces of a component.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pd7YvsOgR0oDykHJht69M",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22105.00583140655,
      "y": 3807.1350040306024,
      "width": 600.9529187607693,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "HF6vU6thaUYOknkUxiIWi"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6SG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 87556320,
      "version": 321,
      "versionNonce": 449008027,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764603458344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "shows architecture of the system\nas deployment (distribution) of\nsoftware artifacts to deployment\ntargets.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "shows architecture of the system as deployment (distribution) of software artifacts to deployment targets.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Hyl0vbRTna70-Fi7peQQH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20536.32279171949,
      "y": 3693.2845670352713,
      "width": 1447.4433206568299,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "HF6vU6thaUYOknkUxiIWi"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6SV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1729389792,
      "version": 654,
      "versionNonce": 2134664763,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764603458344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ELEMENTS\n\n• Artifact: A product developed by the software, symbolized by a rectangle with\nthe name and the word “artifact” enclosed by double arrows.\n• Component: A rectangle with two tabs that indicates a software element.\n• Interface: A circle that indicates a contractual relationship. \n• Node: A hardware or software object, shown by a three-dimensional box.\n• Node as container\n• Stereotype",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ELEMENTS\n\n• Artifact: A product developed by the software, symbolized by a rectangle with the name and the word “artifact” enclosed by double arrows.\n• Component: A rectangle with two tabs that indicates a software element.\n• Interface: A circle that indicates a contractual relationship. \n• Node: A hardware or software object, shown by a three-dimensional box.\n• Node as container\n• Stereotype",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mQ6eneA7uaG7-njBxbw0Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25823.43094259885,
      "y": 2631.6384157218417,
      "width": 448.43070119057637,
      "height": 219.1898698240193,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "HF6vU6thaUYOknkUxiIWi"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6Sl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 690481440,
      "version": 408,
      "versionNonce": 1760159451,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "7SpHQJFUQ5BzL8JQmGvIs",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764603458344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TYPES OF STATES\n\n• Simple state: It does not constitute any\nsubstructure.\n• Composite state: It consists of nested\nstates, such that it does not contain more\nthan one initial state and one final state.\n• Sub-machine state: semantically identical to\nthe composite state, but it can be reused.",
      "fontSize": 19.483543984357272,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TYPES OF STATES\n\n• Simple state: It does not constitute any substructure.\n• Composite state: It consists of nested states, such that it does not contain more than one initial state and one final state.\n• Sub-machine state: semantically identical to the composite state, but it can be reused.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
