      "updated": 1764632885433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "transforming the\nanalysis model\nclass-based\nelements into\nclasses and\ndata structures",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "transforming the analysis model class-based\nelements into classes and data structures",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LP8zzfhU-ELUDWBGSKG8E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31811.284549815176,
      "y": 2102.3281351356636,
      "width": 335.6656412205867,
      "height": 585,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "9pz8hxnyJFRfKG0sY9oI4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1274819808,
      "version": 1199,
      "versionNonce": 1623524175,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764632885433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "defines the\nrelationships\namong the major\nstructural\nelements of the\nsoftware\n\nDerived from the\nclass-based\nelements and\nflow-oriented\nelements of the\nanalysis model",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "defines the relationships among the major structural elements of the software\n\nDerived from the class-based elements and\nflow-oriented elements of the analysis model",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "X_awX2wc-QmIFc1RYVM-n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32227.387499510045,
      "y": 2056.4384469550623,
      "width": 332.21622483387483,
      "height": 585,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#228be6",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "9pz8hxnyJFRfKG0sY9oI4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1818400992,
      "version": 1168,
      "versionNonce": 50708847,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764632885433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "how the software\nelements, hardware\nelements, and end-\nusers communicate\nwith one another\n\nDerived from the\nanalysis model\nscenario-based\nelements, flow-\noriented elements,\nand behavioral\nelements",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "how the software elements, hardware elements, and end-users communicate with one another\n\nDerived from the analysis model scenario-based elements, flow-oriented elements, and behavioral\nelements",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aBk0b2XiRGcikDPrGvP90",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32639.538397176315,
      "y": 2062.049973874183,
      "width": 384.84429741970035,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
