      "updated": 1764495639462,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Brainstorming\n\n1. Storm\n    + come-up with as many ideas as possible QUANTITY >> QUALITY\n    + No criticism or debate permitted (don't inhibit participation)\n    + scribe down ideas for all to see\n    + wilder is better     ...like u\n2. Calm\n    + go through the list of ideas and explain clearly\n    + be careful about time and people; take breaks 90-120 mins.\n    + review and rate\n    + rank ideas\n    + choose winning idea",
      "fontSize": 66.33665672754485,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
