    {
      "id": "Cq-IdKCit3pG9IYdvMgZZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34356.97855349729,
      "y": 5764.372486419254,
      "width": 823.0202787159319,
      "height": 489.4086220011598,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bD9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2047336672,
      "version": 1241,
      "versionNonce": 1262438624,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TYPES OF DESIGN PATTERNS\n\n+ Architectural patterns – High-level strategies\ndefining system structure (subsystems,\ncomponents, classes).\n\n+ Design patterns – Mid-level solutions for common\ndesign problems and component relationships.\n\n+ Idioms – Low-level, language-specific\nimplementation techniques for component behavior\nand interaction.",
      "fontSize": 32.62724146674396,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TYPES OF DESIGN PATTERNS\n\n+ Architectural patterns – High-level strategies defining system structure (subsystems, components, classes).\n\n+ Design patterns – Mid-level solutions for common design problems and component relationships.\n\n+ Idioms – Low-level, language-specific implementation techniques for component behavior and interaction.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "L-F85cx61EqZ7MHs0Xg1t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33499.135436721364,
      "y": 5748.158363613529,
      "width": 763.6410100797094,
      "height": 500.5989301720179,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "B2lgzWWBJ9kdcqjX8O9DM",
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1310864672,
      "version": 1230,
      "versionNonce": 31339808,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 essential elements:\n\n• Pattern name that we use to describe a\ndesign problem\n\n• Problem that describes when to apply the\npattern\n\n• Solution that describes the elements that\nmake up the design\n\n• Consequences of applying the pattern",
      "fontSize": 33.37326201146786,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4 essential elements:\n\n• Pattern name that we use to describe a design problem\n\n• Problem that describes when to apply the pattern\n\n• Solution that describes the elements that make up the design\n\n• Consequences of applying the pattern",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
