    {
      "id": "ulisWW0U8X0z90zqAqa0l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33648.43894660362,
      "y": 6360.0758443290015,
      "width": 881.949841847978,
      "height": 388.5918877947126,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 186505504,
      "version": 1022,
      "versionNonce": 1428518112,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Any complex problem can be more easily handled if\nit's subdivided into pieces that can each be solved\nand optimized independently\n\n• Concern: a feature or behavior that is specified\nas part of the requirements model for the software\n\n• By separating concerns into smaller and\nmanageable pieces -> less effort and time to solve.",
      "fontSize": 34.54150113730776,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Any complex problem can be more easily handled if it's subdivided into pieces that can each be solved and optimized independently\n\n• Concern: a feature or behavior that is specified as part of the requirements model for the software\n\n• By separating concerns into smaller and manageable pieces -> less effort and time to solve.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2Js_HVy3xZglvYl8S9GsR",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 35176.299309200316,
      "y": 6830.959924358955,
      "width": 669.0230917455282,
      "height": 430.7738612318329,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1013820704,
      "version": 957,
      "versionNonce": 297847072,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "status": "saved",
      "fileId": "554911dd5f78e8d367eb668fc3d21a41a629e8e3",
      "scale": [
        1,
        1
      ],
      "crop": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UNg1FY8WMhi6dQcdhm70I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33501.19907239248,
      "y": 6869.831085532329,
      "width": 863.4321466521463,
      "height": 359.48023102170555,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 111256864,
      "version": 1058,
      "versionNonce": 2120472800,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Software is divided into separately addressable\ncomponents called modules, that are integrated\nto satisfy problem requirements.\n\n\"Modularity is the single attribute of software\nthat allows a program to be intellectually\nmanageable\"\n",
      "fontSize": 35.94802310217055,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Software is divided into separately addressable components called modules, that are integrated to satisfy problem requirements.\n\n\"Modularity is the single attribute of software that allows a program to be intellectually manageable\"\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "shOCitQCWYqHFGpZ97fDv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34433.11867991355,
      "y": 6874.198909881494,
      "width": 658.7399564723381,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 488559840,
      "version": 975,
      "versionNonce": 1829414176,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Monolithic software cannot be easily\ngrasped by a software engineer. \n\nIt should be broken into modules, to\nmake understanding easier and\nreduce the cost required to build the\nsoftware.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Monolithic software cannot be easily grasped by a software engineer. \n\nIt should be broken into modules, to make understanding easier and reduce the cost required to build the software.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iIm48ySw0KPxzYwWVm6UM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32845.46018266189,
      "y": 7314.195038584767,
      "width": 575.4612294560777,
      "height": 263.2376701944031,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 308253920,
      "version": 958,
      "versionNonce": 976600288,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "FIQ-J0DeUArDdIWjgFJQ9",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Modules should be specified and\ndesigned so that information\ncontained within a module is\ninaccessible to other modules\nthat have no need for such\ninformation.",
      "fontSize": 35.0983560259204,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Modules should be specified and designed so that information contained within a module is inaccessible to other modules that have no need for such information.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KRujt_V28PeLo3YNmARhr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32923.12661794585,
      "y": 7145.486831465369,
      "width": 291.1054534184412,
      "height": 98.18891519072346,
      "angle": 0.3558201723464389,
      "strokeColor": "#e64980",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 61795616,
