    {
      "id": "4ZEJGcpJe2I3NqKKWyRbM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33559.80967119358,
      "y": 7498.939715413413,
      "width": 1038.487863596587,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1592430880,
      "version": 1242,
      "versionNonce": 1781211360,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "FIQ-J0DeUArDdIWjgFJQ9",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADVANTAGES\n\n• Reduces the likelihood of “side effects”\n• Limits the global impact of local design decisions\n• Emphasizes communication through controlled interfaces\n• Discourages the use of global data\n• Leads to encapsulation\n• Higher quality software",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADVANTAGES\n\n• Reduces the likelihood of “side effects”\n• Limits the global impact of local design decisions\n• Emphasizes communication through controlled interfaces\n• Discourages the use of global data\n• Leads to encapsulation\n• Higher quality software",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_14EK5zsuktZlt2p-FRa7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32033.130953964126,
      "y": 7521.616218169696,
      "width": 737.6641595463338,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1589432608,
      "version": 932,
      "versionNonce": 2050743584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "9vTSq3sM5ENuziDSPkx9M",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "AEKitB0_pIZ_tytoof2cY",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Achieved by developing modules with\n\"single-minded\" function and an \"aversion\"\nto excessive interaction with other\nmodules.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Achieved by developing modules with\n\"single-minded\" function and an \"aversion\" to excessive interaction with other modules.\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "69npGC2_d3Ta_CtmDPHFS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32606.160272872265,
      "y": 7995.596858442093,
      "width": 666.1862681000872,
      "height": 516.0266031561605,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 65233120,
      "version": 2967,
      "versionNonce": 1037305056,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "9vTSq3sM5ENuziDSPkx9M",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "COUPLING\n\nCoupling is an indication of the\nrelative interdependence among\nmodules.\n\nCoupling depends on the interface\ncomplexity between modules, the\npoint at which entry or reference is\nmade to a module, and what data\npass across the interface.",
      "fontSize": 37.52920750226622,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "COUPLING\n\nCoupling is an indication of the relative interdependence among\nmodules.\n\nCoupling depends on the interface complexity between modules, the\npoint at which entry or reference is made to a module, and what data\npass across the interface.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9vTSq3sM5ENuziDSPkx9M",
      "type": "arrow",
