    {
      "id": "IzynsH5DmUFhZ-vD0Iu82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31733.34895982107,
      "y": 7975.919531222025,
      "width": 673.2089294761439,
      "height": 609.5369466847607,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 384650464,
      "version": 1116,
      "versionNonce": 1925212384,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "AEKitB0_pIZ_tytoof2cY",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "COHESION\n\nCohesion is an indication of the\nrelative functional strength of a\nmodule.\n\nA cohesive module performs a single\ntask, requiring little interaction with\nother components in other parts of\na program. \nA cohesive module should (ideally)\ndo just one thing.\n",
      "fontSize": 37.509965949831425,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "COHESION\n\nCohesion is an indication of the relative functional strength of a\nmodule.\n\nA cohesive module performs a single task, requiring little interaction with other components in other parts of a program. \nA cohesive module should (ideally) do just one thing.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
