      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Refinement is a process of elaboration.\n\n• Top down technique for decomposition of a system\nfrom high level speciation's to elementary steps.\n\n• Terminates when all instructions are expressed in\nterms of any underlying computer or programming\nlanguage.\n\n• Also known as stepwise program development.\n\n• Abstraction and refinement are complementary\nconcepts.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Refinement is a process of elaboration.\n\n• Top down technique for decomposition of a system from high level speciation's to elementary steps.\n\n• Terminates when all instructions are expressed in terms of any underlying computer or programming language.\n\n• Also known as stepwise program development.\n\n• Abstraction and refinement are complementary concepts.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
