    {
      "id": "HKMkW_20eqVtFyDZ-tc_8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30075.402654657857,
      "y": 5788.003879084054,
      "width": 896.610670013813,
      "height": 446.6893763449184,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1669616928,
      "version": 1386,
      "versionNonce": 1280637152,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Inheritance- all responsibilities of a\nsuperclass is immediately inherited by all\nsubclasses.\n\n• Messages- stimulate some behavior to occur\nin the receiving object.\n\n• Polymorphism- greatly reduces the effort\nrequired to extend the design.",
      "fontSize": 39.705722341770525,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Inheritance- all responsibilities of a superclass is immediately inherited by all subclasses.\n\n• Messages- stimulate some behavior to occur in the receiving object.\n\n• Polymorphism- greatly reduces the effort required to extend the design.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
