    {
      "id": "nlRj8mqMA3HTJsKA5Ezau",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31301.58854283843,
      "y": 4480.206669412252,
      "width": 642.890032056028,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1027889376,
      "version": 1046,
      "versionNonce": 106184928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "zu4_ggsvYh1FKc0zwl_qj",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BOUNDARY CLASSES\n\nBoundary classes are developed\nduring design to create the\ninterface that the user sees and\ninteracts with.\n\nDesigned with the responsibility of\nmanaging the way entity objects are\nrepresented to users.\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BOUNDARY CLASSES\n\nBoundary classes are developed during design to create the\ninterface that the user sees and interacts with.\n\nDesigned with the responsibility of managing the way entity objects are represented to users.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sj5Zt2xTQJbcHUWhVidJ8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30061.592821471855,
      "y": 5111.8561186746665,
      "width": 917.229701768043,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "e9pnScmRsSq_MUGJpNfyG"
      ],
      "frameId": "nmdQ86d6GcWHU9s4PiMlj",
      "index": "bDc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 145280288,
      "version": 1240,
      "versionNonce": 1756675360,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "lX7QgplvbO8HdcWfaZP4y",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764511352212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CONTROLLER CLASSES to manage:\n\n• the creation or update of entity objects\n\n• the instantiation of boundary objects as they\nobtain information from entity objects\n\n• complex communication between sets of objects\n\n• validation of data communicated between objects\nor between the user and the application.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CONTROLLER CLASSES to manage:\n\n• the creation or update of entity objects\n\n• the instantiation of boundary objects as they obtain information from entity objects\n\n• complex communication between sets of objects\n\n• validation of data communicated between objects or between the user and the application.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
