    {
      "id": "BykCXlAw2IrW6uWZOyUNb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22250.140097373238,
      "y": -8929.829502015755,
      "width": 851.7455664088768,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "83wvn8HMszrDMv_NHimxI",
      "index": "bFSzV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1074373819,
      "version": 287,
      "versionNonce": 158844885,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764505099131,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sommerville et al. ... air traffic control system\n\nSurprising observations\n\n    Controllers often put aircrafts on potentially conflicting headings with the intention of fixing them later\n\n    System generates an audible alarm when there is a possible conflict\n\n    The controllers close the alarms because they are annoyed by the constant warnings\n\nIncorrect conclusion\n\n    The controllers do not like audible alarms because they close them\n\nMore accurate observation\n\n    The controllers do not like being treated like idiots",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sommerville et al. ... air traffic control system\n\nSurprising observations\n\n    Controllers often put aircrafts on potentially conflicting headings with the intention of fixing them later\n\n    System generates an audible alarm when there is a possible conflict\n\n    The controllers close the alarms because they are annoyed by the constant warnings\n\nIncorrect conclusion\n\n    The controllers do not like audible alarms because they close them\n\nMore accurate observation\n\n    The controllers do not like being treated like idiots",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
