      "seed": 1208185120,
      "version": 483,
      "versionNonce": 1776593120,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764506244846,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Similarities: \n\n+ Goal- package engineering\nexperience\n\n+ Formulation- organization\nand interaction among “key”\ncomponents.",
      "fontSize": 33.73154327095198,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Similarities: \n\n+ Goal- package engineering experience\n\n+ Formulation- organization and interaction among “key” components.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xygC6TJ5GaS0D0bXwqzuC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40010.55503102824,
      "y": 1931.2560083750368,
      "width": 531.3813944115722,
      "height": 337.3154327095198,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0000ff",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "kpbGOZegG5Dyono6Kd8Pk"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1765554400,
      "version": 452,
      "versionNonce": 488410336,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764506244846,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Differences:\n\nMany architectural styles have\nbeen well known for a long time\nin the software engineering\ncommunity.\nPatterns are a relatively recent\ndevelopment in OO design.",
      "fontSize": 33.73154327095198,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Differences:\n\nMany architectural styles have been well known for a long time in the software engineering community.\nPatterns are a relatively recent development in OO design.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aWjU43BN8ffom5CB56J8G",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40930.15967460211,
      "y": 1583.548010198148,
      "width": 1186.2083026035289,
      "height": 355.7437030001822,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1905958112,
      "version": 860,
      "versionNonce": 361364704,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764500138460,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- not the operational software itself\n- rather, a representation that enables:\n\n    (1) analyzing the effectiveness of the design\n\n    (2) consider architectural alternatives when making changes is still easy\n\n    (3) reduce the risks\n    ",
      "fontSize": 31.621662488905088,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- not the operational software itself\n- rather, a representation that enables:\n\n    (1) analyzing the effectiveness of the design\n\n    (2) consider architectural alternatives when making changes is still easy\n\n    (3) reduce the risks\n    ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KO77zoWjTMu394ALUe0Zi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42430.59700175389,
      "y": 1326.7764463368542,
      "width": 949.5231704883734,
      "height": 387.16130008617887,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 984607968,
      "version": 956,
      "versionNonce": 90394912,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764502493198,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IMPORTANCE\n\n• Enables communication between all parties (stakeholders)\n\n• Highlights early design decisions that'll have a profound impact on\nall software engineering work that follows and on the ultimate\nsuccess of the system.\n\n• Architecture “constitutes a relatively small, intellectually graspable\nmode of how the system is structured and how its components work\ntogether”",
      "fontSize": 28.157185460813007,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IMPORTANCE\n\n• Enables communication between all parties (stakeholders)\n\n• Highlights early design decisions that'll have a profound impact on all software engineering work that follows and on the ultimate success of the system.\n\n• Architecture “constitutes a relatively small, intellectually graspable mode of how the system is structured and how its components work together”",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
