      "updated": 1764636254102,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Data-Centered Architecture",
      "fontSize": 43.801279683117905,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Data-Centered Architecture",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wu6DQ4Tditva_W4fybiDW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42082.52306415707,
      "y": 3551.560656842207,
      "width": 947.194154159718,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e64980",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "QMh-iPiSFnQbhlYFyWcU4"
      ],
      "frameId": "n5TI8-Uc5D9VqiQvGLoEB",
      "index": "bFl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 335019296,
      "version": 920,
      "versionNonce": 1078760463,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764636254102,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Goal- integrating the data\n\n• Systems in which the access and update of a widely\naccessed data store occur.\n\n• A blackboard notifies subscriber clients when\nchanges occur in data of interest\n\n• Clients are independent of each other so they can\nbe added, removed, or changed in functionality\n\n• The data store is independent of the clients",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Goal- integrating the data\n\n• Systems in which the access and update of a widely accessed data store occur.\n\n• A blackboard notifies subscriber clients when changes occur in data of interest\n\n• Clients are independent of each other so they can be added, removed, or changed in functionality\n\n• The data store is independent of the clients",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8xPPI4Z-iH9OVzttF9cp7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 43624.39849306006,
      "y": 3229.9074974762634,
      "width": 531.4516968760742,
      "height": 276.26579345765333,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#099268",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "n5TI8-Uc5D9VqiQvGLoEB",
      "index": "bFm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 314440992,
      "version": 596,
      "versionNonce": 1730279712,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764502795779,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHEN TO USE THIS\n\nUse this style when a central\nissue is the storage,\nrepresentation, management, and\nretrieval of a large amount of\nrelated persistent data .",
      "fontSize": 31.573233538017526,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHEN TO USE THIS\n\nUse this style when a central issue is the storage, representation, management, and retrieval of a large amount of related persistent data .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
