      "text": "Data Flow Architecture",
      "fontSize": 47.05095085952486,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Data Flow Architecture",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xeaiCzHqLIgWXtXv08lHr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38899.95879951594,
      "y": 4053.100307079907,
      "width": 1258.950975284439,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e64980",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "N-EOQFh2JGASSqPzMjIdH",
      "index": "bFp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1576868064,
      "version": 742,
      "versionNonce": 389946592,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764502681958,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Goal- Modifiability\n\n• Characterized by viewing the system as a series of transformations\non successive pieces of input data\n\n• Data enters the system and then flows through the components one\nat a time until they are assigned to output or a data store\n\n• Batch sequential style\n    • The processing steps are independent components\n    • Each step runs to completion before the next step begins\n\n• Pipe-and-filter style\n    + Incremental transformation of data by successive components\n    + The filters use little contextual information and retain no state\n    + The pipes are stateless and exist to move data between filters",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Goal- Modifiability\n\n• Characterized by viewing the system as a series of transformations on successive pieces of input data\n\n• Data enters the system and then flows through the components one at a time until they are assigned to output or a data store\n\n• Batch sequential style\n    • The processing steps are independent components\n    • Each step runs to completion before the next step begins\n\n• Pipe-and-filter style\n    + Incremental transformation of data by successive components\n    + The filters use little contextual information and retain no state\n    + The pipes are stateless and exist to move data between filters",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vD87KrGPJEu1ebzb6bHdH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39474.40208878446,
      "y": 3759.0438697782406,
      "width": 485.4949350393682,
      "height": 221.76972058298725,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "N-EOQFh2JGASSqPzMjIdH",
      "index": "bFq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 354307360,
      "version": 440,
      "versionNonce": 1363013856,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764502475317,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "+ Filters: Subsystems\n+ Pipes: Associations between the filters\n\n• Filters only know the content and format of\ndata being received and produced – nothing about\nthe other filters in the system\n\n• Filters are executed concurrently and\nsynchronization is done via pipes ",
      "fontSize": 19.71286405182109,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "+ Filters: Subsystems\n+ Pipes: Associations between the filters\n\n• Filters only know the content and format of data being received and produced – nothing about the other filters in the system\n\n• Filters are executed concurrently and synchronization is done via pipes ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "c5XRi2aY7zPB1gUPK63OH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40943.60537065045,
      "y": 3736.274515742824,
      "width": 535.6351189393389,
      "height": 420.60087664328154,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#099268",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "N-EOQFh2JGASSqPzMjIdH",
      "index": "bFr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1811327200,
      "version": 451,
      "versionNonce": 1166814432,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764517311024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHEN TO USE THIS\n\nUse this style when it makes sense\nto view your system as one that\nproduces a well-defined easily\nidentified output\n\nThe output should be a direct\nresult of sequentially transforming\na well-defined input in a time-\nindependent fashion",
      "fontSize": 30.589154664965932,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHEN TO USE THIS\n\nUse this style when it makes sense to view your system as one that\nproduces a well-defined easily identified output\n\nThe output should be a direct result of sequentially transforming a well-defined input in a time-independent fashion",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
