    {
      "id": "mnOXzVulcAmoNIGB8vZj2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38867.65862312676,
      "y": 3010.7145729469025,
      "width": 858.4759776272729,
      "height": 467.08942106147583,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "N-EOQFh2JGASSqPzMjIdH",
      "index": "bG7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 341632288,
      "version": 406,
      "versionNonce": 1125758240,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "0egmWySnJN5oGIjo1DNKG",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1764502475317,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n• Ordering of filters can be difficult to maintain so the\nfilters cannot cooperatively interact to solve a problem\n\n• Filters typically force the least common denominator of\ndata representation(usually ASCII stream)\n\n• Filters need unlimited buffers if they cannot start\nproducing output until they receive all of the input\n\n• Each filter operates as a separate process, incurring\noverhead in set-up and take-down time",
      "fontSize": 28.743964373013895,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n• Ordering of filters can be difficult to maintain so the filters cannot cooperatively interact to solve a problem\n\n• Filters typically force the least common denominator of data representation(usually ASCII stream)\n\n• Filters need unlimited buffers if they cannot start producing output until they receive all of the input\n\n• Each filter operates as a separate process, incurring overhead in set-up and take-down time",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
