    {
      "id": "aJpd5hGQgBnWF3VI0fMJ3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 43470.415002606765,
      "y": 2327.532543125317,
      "width": 660.5544797536267,
      "height": 427.5311538448155,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "n5TI8-Uc5D9VqiQvGLoEB",
      "index": "bGC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1509465312,
      "version": 360,
      "versionNonce": 1590023456,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764502795779,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADVANTAGES\n\n• Provides scalability which provides easy\nto add or update knowledge source.\n\n• Provides concurrency that allows all\nknowledge sources to work in parallel as\nthey are independent of each other.\n\n• Supports reusability of knowledge source\nagents",
      "fontSize": 31.09317482507749,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADVANTAGES\n\n• Provides scalability which provides easy to add or update knowledge source.\n\n• Provides concurrency that allows all knowledge sources to work in parallel as they are independent of each other.\n\n• Supports reusability of knowledge source agents",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Mt3MUJx1xJQ-x9BgPesl1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42008.944156948826,
      "y": 2432.081132460884,
      "width": 648.3872710350787,
      "height": 339.5380471667575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "n5TI8-Uc5D9VqiQvGLoEB",
      "index": "bGD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 71265504,
      "version": 390,
      "versionNonce": 1838035232,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764502795779,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n• The structure change of blackboard may\nhave a significant impact on all of its\nagents as close dependency exists between\nblackboard and knowledge source.\n\n• Problems in synchronization of multiple\nagents.",
      "fontSize": 30.18115974815622,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n• The structure change of blackboard may have a significant impact on all of its agents as close dependency exists between blackboard and knowledge source.\n\n• Problems in synchronization of multiple agents.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
