    {
      "id": "vamiQi5JV-3Hg_kc2i-Rh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 44908.92280400936,
      "y": 3477.6201927698107,
      "width": 1247.3735614993714,
      "height": 585,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e64980",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "VZ1AudaCeyfLQKdv3huXO",
      "index": "bGN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2045143264,
      "version": 274,
      "versionNonce": 146746656,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764503494099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Goal- Modifiability and Scalability\n\n• Main program and subroutine style:\n    + Decomposes a program hierarchically into small pieces (modules)\n    + Single thread of control that travels through various components\nin the hierarchy\n    \n• Remote procedure call style:\n    + Main program and subroutine style of system that is decomposed\ninto parts that are resident on computers connected via a network\n    + Increases performance by distributing the computations among\nmultiple processors\n    + finite communication time between subroutine call and response ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Goal- Modifiability and Scalability\n\n• Main program and subroutine style:\n    + Decomposes a program hierarchically into small pieces (modules)\n    + Single thread of control that travels through various components in the hierarchy\n    \n• Remote procedure call style:\n    + Main program and subroutine style of system that is decomposed into parts that are resident on computers connected via a network\n    + Increases performance by distributing the computations among multiple processors\n    + finite communication time between subroutine call and response ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZaS3AU_vcYZGM_O8GAcbI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 46056.86957875624,
      "y": 2489.073070523302,
      "width": 615.9369732270457,
      "height": 203.1655741217561,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "VZ1AudaCeyfLQKdv3huXO",
      "index": "bGO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 619754784,
      "version": 282,
      "versionNonce": 1050446112,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764503494099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADVANTAGES\n\n• They enable code modularity.\n• They are easy to scale and modify.\n",
      "fontSize": 32.506491859480974,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADVANTAGES\n\n• They enable code modularity.\n• They are easy to scale and modify.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YndhuR6keAyVLsT1JYXNI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 44794.65843443792,
      "y": 2364.7754731743285,
      "width": 742.542285780044,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "VZ1AudaCeyfLQKdv3huXO",
      "index": "bGP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 27051232,
      "version": 205,
      "versionNonce": 141452576,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764503494099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n• If interfaces are not well-defined, it\nmay lead to tight data coupling.\n\n• If internal data structures change, it\nmay result in ripples to other modules.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n• If interfaces are not well-defined, it may lead to tight data coupling.\n\n• If internal data structures change, it may result in ripples to other modules.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "skiLH-yvVA8DJx3s6IAsa",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 45886.19008549952,
      "y": 2671.296333563743,
      "width": 129.74747535907952,
      "height": 108.04454304779985,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
