    },
    {
      "id": "pIAWimSHmVBO82E3YAttY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 43236.61507670325,
      "y": 4716.906061264126,
      "width": 1033.2453262519318,
      "height": 774.0263706565838,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "zZ7dGZM2bjQa8qHOMTOxd",
      "index": "bGsl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 863874272,
      "version": 408,
      "versionNonce": 1609971936,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764506130158,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADVANTAGES\n\n+ Links an application to real-world objects to make it more\nintelligible.\n\n+ Because of the reused programs, it is simple to maintain\nand increases the system’s quality.\n\n+ Through polymorphism and abstraction, this design ensures\nreusability.\n\n+ It has the ability to handle mistakes while running\n(Robustness)\n\n+ It has the ability to add new features without affecting\nthe system’s functioning.\n\n+ Encapsulating code enhances testability.",
      "fontSize": 34.4011720291815,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADVANTAGES\n\n+ Links an application to real-world objects to make it more intelligible.\n\n+ Because of the reused programs, it is simple to maintain and increases the system’s quality.\n\n+ Through polymorphism and abstraction, this design ensures reusability.\n\n+ It has the ability to handle mistakes while running (Robustness)\n\n+ It has the ability to add new features without affecting the system’s functioning.\n\n+ Encapsulating code enhances testability.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IZmyP-SGICGAg008TdWSV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42073.82713071433,
      "y": 4710.433062962567,
      "width": 989.096090377694,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "zZ7dGZM2bjQa8qHOMTOxd",
      "index": "bGst",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1702430944,
      "version": 237,
      "versionNonce": 2054954208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764506130158,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n+ The determination of all the essential classes and\nobjects for a system with an object-oriented design is\ndifficult.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n+ The determination of all the essential classes and objects for a system with an object-oriented design is difficult.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
