      "updated": 1764506167411,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Model View Controller(MVC) \nDesign Pattern",
      "fontSize": 65.5783952594495,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Model View Controller(MVC) \nDesign Pattern",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ita2dHXlB8C-M4dwXmCkM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 41909.37305122423,
      "y": 7589.1437070827815,
      "width": 932.5476739932635,
      "height": 619.221505184732,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "bUfxcIGOD8s5SWgrwIchb"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 304985312,
      "version": 542,
      "versionNonce": 694496480,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764506167411,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADVANTAGES\n\n• Easy code maintenance which is easy to\nextend and grow\n\n• MVC Model component can be tested\nseparately from the user\n\n• Easier support for new types of clients\n\n• Development of the various components can\nbe performed parallelly.",
      "fontSize": 41.28143367898214,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADVANTAGES\n\n• Easy code maintenance which is easy to extend and grow\n\n• MVC Model component can be tested separately from the user\n\n• Easier support for new types of clients\n\n• Development of the various components can be performed parallelly.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "trGiQlAy4mRGxWVMKOG_0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 43090.224508148014,
      "y": 7563.842296145309,
      "width": 915.821555458623,
      "height": 685.978777387438,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "bUfxcIGOD8s5SWgrwIchb"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2028246304,
      "version": 412,
      "versionNonce": 569151712,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764506167411,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n• Difficult to read, change, unit test, and reuse\nthis model\n\n• The framework navigation can be complex as\nit introduces new layers of abstraction which\nrequires users to adapt to the decomposition\ncriteria of MVC.\n\n• No formal validation support\n\n• Increased complexity and Inefficiency of\ndata",
      "fontSize": 39.198787279282165,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DISADVANTAGES\n\n• Difficult to read, change, unit test, and reuse this model\n\n• The framework navigation can be complex as it introduces new layers of abstraction which requires users to adapt to the decomposition criteria of MVC.\n\n• No formal validation support\n\n• Increased complexity and Inefficiency of data",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
